{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫（TVB）力捧小生何廣沛（Matthew）早前宣布計劃與拍拖約兩年的圈外公關女友Sarah拉埋天窗，喜訊一出隨即獲全城送上祝福！踏入年尾，準新郎何廣沛終於在社交平台大派福利，高調上載二人的甜蜜婚紗照，更自爆今次遠赴英國倫敦取景拍攝，前後一共拍下了超過一千張珍貴照片與影片，務求全方位記錄人生最幸福的一刻。</p><figure><img alt=\"何廣沛早前宣佈將娶圈外女友。（IG@matthew_hkp）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261124/1201892113013280768403851.jpeg/i5zpWjUwtizUbJ7T-wgej9NgxQGHbYAodw2eEXcNnhE\"/><figcaption>何廣沛早前宣佈將娶圈外女友。（IG@matthew_hkp）</figcaption></figure><p>何廣沛霸氣承諾餘生寵妻</p><p>除了絕美婚照令人艷羨，何廣沛更在帖文中附上一篇深情款款的「愛的宣言」，字裡行間流露出對未來太太的極致寵溺，甜度爆燈，令無數網民大呼感動：「在倫敦這個總依戀雨點的地方，遇上了冬天最難得的陽光，愛你是我一生最堅定的選擇，期待迎接我們人生的下一章。餘生，准許我用一輩子繼續寵愛你」一句「用一輩子繼續寵愛你」霸氣又溫柔，盡顯「絕世好老公」風範，甜過蜜糖！</p><figure><img alt=\"何廣沛霸氣承諾餘生寵妻：「用一輩子繼續寵愛你」。（IG@matthew_hkp）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261124/1201893338924453888056912.jpeg/0223i_uyz9MfSiNGQbh55hKiI5sJ-QQs5YS04-WEtOM\"/><figcaption>何廣沛霸氣承諾餘生寵妻：「用一輩子繼續寵愛你」。（IG@matthew_hkp）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"何廣沛公開甜爆婚照。（IG@matthew_hkp）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261124/1201892334246170624057123.jpeg/tNpaP3EMEsli4WaE_rYSIk8X-VoWKUqsmMhsSpjIbEo\"/><figcaption>何廣沛公開甜爆婚照。（IG@matthew_hkp）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好Sweet！（IG@matthew_hkp）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261124/1201892331888840704027614.jpeg/_7SD5Zo8pS8RzxgpCJZ50s9e-RNl5aifF7y_1Re8v9U\"/><figcaption>好Sweet！（IG@matthew_hkp）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"何廣沛同Sarah去到英國倫敦影婚紗照。（IG@matthew_hkp）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261124/1201892344614883328940785.jpeg/pTAKaUNQ7F71SYKVMXJlL-RaOytegeV5L141fC9eNXw\"/><figcaption>何廣沛同Sarah去到英國倫敦影婚紗照。（IG@matthew_hkp）</figcaption></figure><p>何廣沛更在帖文末段特意標註了「#countdownbegins」（倒數開始）的標籤，強烈暗示二人的正式大婚之日已經近在咫尺！隨著婚照正式曝光兼進入最後倒數階段，相信這對準新人很快便會正式步入禮堂，攜手迎接人生的嶄新篇章，全城粉絲亦紛紛湧入留言區洗版恭賀，祝願二人白頭到老、永結同心！</p><figure><img alt=\"恭喜！（IG@matthew_hkp）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261124/1201892342366605312681295.jpeg/-lhiqNif8bCMxsdzWRMvFmIvzkeFhPWStrN3gLazd4A\"/><figcaption>恭喜！（IG@matthew_hkp）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"何廣沛高呼一生最堅定選擇就係要娶未婚妻。（IG@matthew_hkp）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261124/1201892340118327296073516.jpeg/D0rYg9Ne5KU2oTbWLAhhCFGFFWG8MOd1H5lrGB-Zaxg\"/><figcaption>何廣沛高呼一生最堅定選擇就係要娶未婚妻。（IG@matthew_hkp）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"何廣沛同Sarah大婚在即。（IG@matthew_hkp）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261124/1201892337832300544648239.jpeg/QE3qbDaPF00A1_KaK8r6BIjwXVdY12iLjJP0q4yT9Ks\"/><figcaption>何廣沛同Sarah大婚在即。（IG@matthew_hkp）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"期待二人的婚禮日子。（IG@matthew_hkp）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261124/1201892335613382656608452.jpeg/h5M_pb4ZaXAPkJffMXYdkvbjCKVs9FPBItHoISLR6CE\"/><figcaption>期待二人的婚禮日子。（IG@matthew_hkp）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T06:35:01.584325+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":757,"images":9,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T06:00:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T06:57:24.252055+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T06:28:25.751405+00:00","content_hash":"fa1a932185ad01e6a85fdc055c259a37c4b28096181118281f6e2f59d9dffc87","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}